---
title: "Old deployment stop and lost-response recovery"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: planned
    lg1: stopped
    lg2: recovery
    lg3: done
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 orange
  class lg3 purple
  s0: Intent pins the old deployment
  s1: One stop effect reserved
  s2: Nomad accepted one guarded stop
  s3: Waiting for pinned allocations to terminate
  s4: Stop response was lost
  s5: Pinned allocations are terminal
  s6: Same intent checks the stop marker
  s7: Stop and drain receipt complete
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: reserve one operation under the exact intent
  s1 --> s2: Nomad accepts one old-revision CAS stop
  s2 --> s3: the stop response includes its revision receipt
  s2 --> s4: the stop commits but its response is lost
  s3 --> s5: Nomad confirms each pinned old allocation is terminal
  s4 --> s6: restart the same durable operation
  s5 --> s7: record verified stop and drain evidence
  s6 --> s3: read the exact marker without another stop write
  class s0 blue
  class s1 blue
  class s2 teal
  class s3 teal
  class s4 orange
  class s5 teal
  class s6 orange
  class s7 purple
